      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is no ability to return string when there is SUCCESS with Binder\u0027s status object. Because we always had struct Result in HAL, there was an ability to return string message even with SUCCESS case. We will lose that if I get rid of parcelable now. There is no way of knowing right now if OEM\u0027s have used it for success case. Is it worth getting it done with binder Status object and lose that ability?",
